  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An angled stippling brush featuring vegan fiber technology and custom bristles for effortless blush application. <b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The lightweight aluminum handle provides a comfortable grip for precise control. This brush was developed to enhance the performance of Unreal Liquid Blush (sold separately) and can also be used with any liquid and cream cheek products.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the angled side of the brush, lightly dip brush into cream or liquid blush. <br>-For blush, start at the apples of the cheeks, gently stippling in soft, upward motions. <br>-Repeat until desired result is achieved.</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>An angled stippling brush featuring vegan fiber technology and custom bristles for effortless blush application. <b><br><br>Brush Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Brush Coverage:</b> Buildable<br><b><br>Bristle Type:</b> Synthetic <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The lightweight aluminum handle provides a comfortable grip for precise control. This brush was developed to enhance the performance of Unreal Liquid Blush (sold separately) and can also be used with any liquid and cream cheek products.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the angled side of the brush, lightly dip brush into cream or liquid blush. <br>-For blush, start at the apples of the cheeks, gently stippling in soft, upward motions. <br>-Repeat until desired result is achieved.</div></details>",
